@startuml STATE-01-template-lifecycle
title STATE-01 - Template Package Lifecycle

hide empty description

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam stateBorderThickness 1
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    FontColor black
}

[*] --> Draft

Draft --> Validating : Validate
Validating --> Draft : Validation Error
Validating --> Packaged : Manifest Valid

Packaged --> Submitted : Submit Issue
Submitted --> Scanning : Trigger Webhook

Scanning --> Draft : Scan Failed
Scanning --> UnderReview : Scan Passed

UnderReview --> Draft : Changes Requested
UnderReview --> Listed : Maintainer Approved

Listed --> Deprecated : Deprecate
Listed --> Withdrawn : Delist

Deprecated --> Withdrawn : Retire
Withdrawn --> [*]
Draft --> [*] : Delete

@enduml